'leoville-poyferre|2025':{v:'2 hours Price : €1,250 per group Create your own tasting journey through the vintages of Léoville Poyferré. An exclusive experience, hosted in one of the château’s most private settings. Within the quiet atmosphere of our historic cellar, this visit offers a rare moment of discovery, shaped around your wishes, your memories and the years that hold meaning for you. Guided by our team, you will curate your own selection from a collection of vintages, with bottles dating back as far as the 1970s. Each wine reveals the story of a year, a terroir and the precise craftsmanship that has shaped Léoville Poyferré over time. A private & deeply personnal experience.',src:'2025__en-2025-en-primeur.txt',label:'the cellar ',lang:'en'},
'lynch-bages|2022':{v:'a functionalist architecture designed with wine in mind 2017 2020 2008 The renovation project started with the help of the American architect Chien Chung Pei. The new winery aims to improve the precision of the wine-making process. Marking four centuries of history and the culmination of four years’ hard work, the 2020 vintage, the first born in the renovated cellars, opened a new chapter in the life of the estate. A decisive step is taken with the emergence of precision viticulture. The satellite mapping tools precisely analyze each parcel’s potential and determine the characteristic features of each terroir.',src:'ft_lynch-bages-2022_chateau-lynch-bages-2022-eng-technical-sheet.pdf',label:'The winery: ',lang:'en'},
'lynch-bages|2023':{v:'a functionalist architecture designed with wine in mind 2017 2020 2008 The renovation project started with the help of the American architect Chien Chung Pei. The new winery aims to improve the precision of the wine-making process. Marking four centuries of history and the culmination of four years’ hard work, the 2020 vintage, the first born in the renovated cellars, opened a new chapter in the life of the estate. A decisive step is taken with the emergence of precision viticulture. The satellite mapping tools precisely analyze each parcel’s potential and determine the characteristic features of each terroir.',src:'Chateau-Lynch-Bages-2023-ENG-Technical-sheet.pdf',label:'The winery: ',lang:'en'},
